        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-26",
        "notes": "All five steps independently calculated. Gaussian block residuals are independent of design; affine independence yields rank |S|+1; m=n-|S|-1>=3 leaves residual columns rank two and centered covariance positive definite. Rotational density yields independent chi_m, normal and chi_(m-1); atanh(R)=asinh(q/W). Lipschitz asinh and |rho|<=M<1 give L=4M/sqrt(1-M^2)+2. Chernoff chi-square tails give 2 exp(-ku^2/8); replacing m-1 by m and delta/2 gives 4 exp(-m delta^2/64), plus normal term. For delta<2/m trivial probability bound fits constant 6. delta=t/L<=1/2 yields constants 6 and 1/(64L^2), uniform in dimensions/design. Checked empty S, M=0, smallest m=3, t=1 and small t; no singular covariance/endpoints |rho|=1 allowed."
      }
