        "notes": "Checked all 13 proof steps against algorithm R1–R3 and local equivalence/chordal suppliers. Opposite orientations create forbidden collider or cycle; G remains extension. Earliest orientation-time argument (3.1,4.1–4.3) establishes external-parent propagation; step 3.2 then yields chordal undirected components with no internal directed edge. Quotient cycle would lift via propagation to directed cycle. Independent collider-free component orientations give both directions of every residual edge with no new collider; exact extension class follows by skeleton/collider theorem. Step 3.2 is presented before the remaining cases proving the claim it uses; these cases do not use 3.2, so there is no logical cycle. Empty components/edge-free graphs are vacuous. No background rule R4 or AC."
